Refine an existing local draft

Usage: mxr draft refine [OPTIONS] <DRAFT_ID>

Arguments:
  <DRAFT_ID>

Options:
      --shorter
      --warmer
      --more-formal
      --less-emoji
      --add-context <ADD_CONTEXT>
  -h, --help                       Print help
